 ~importlib.metadata:PackageNotFoundError,version
 $L-SDF: The Agent-First Documentation Tool.
 !main(ctx,verbose) > _package_version
 $Scans source code to generate .lsdf indices.
 !gen(ctx,path,recursive,depth) > _find_project_root,_load_lsdfignore,_read_meta,_package_version,_iter_walk_roots,_is_ignored_path,_build_index_content,_combined_source_hash,_hash_str,_write_meta
 $Translates L-SDF into Markdown.
 !trans(file,output)
 $Bootstraps a repository with L-SDF config and agent rules.
