 $Verifies that indices are up-to-date.
 !sync(ctx,path,check) > _find_project_root,_load_lsdfignore,_read_meta,_iter_walk_roots,_is_ignored_path,_combined_source_hash,_hash_str,_build_index_content
 $Calculates token savings (Source Code vs. L-SDF Indices).
